{"data":{"body":"**P1 \u2014 Complete the caller with fatal restoration failures.** This publishes the selected outcome even when `restore.close()` is unwinding with `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`. With an asynchronous executor, `execute()` can therefore return `SUCCEEDED`/`PENDING` while the fatal reaches only the worker\u2019s uncaught-exception handler. Complete `result` exceptionally with the original fatal before rethrowing it on the owner thread, and assert that the caller receives that same fatal.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77INQO","finding_digest":"d43371534e39ba8ef3db8885e66b122c9182a4cc77f87519192245519be87d31","finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-cleanup-propagation","line":260,"observation_digest":"c241d6a5859a947eb58d7db1f3c60bd888aa7b3141266b251bbc1968f619d827","observation_id":"aro_v1_yja5njmftkkh5nmnpwy7hrql3c","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_2qzxcu2ohg5i5463rcc6m2ysfs","published_at":"2026-10-07T23:58:40Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ahpygitvijm2xuf5p2wjqxp4wv","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"dceb158abc6b47b3cbbdc07b99e5d70e670f4826","reviewer":"codex","start_line":260,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_rx4isx4ylhyvhz57doym3fsgkx","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T23:58:40Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
